# PROVISIONAL — CANON REVIEW REQUIRED: the Lower Trial Hall's rooms (2026-11-04), owner list item 9.
~ trial_store_door
Store Door: A storeroom door, barred on the far side by a drop latch. Through the gap, something large stands very still.
- "Lift the latch through the gap, quietly." [#tag=SLIP] [if not GameState.get_flag("trial_store_door_open") and not GameState.get_flag("trial_store_pick_failed") and check("slip", 40) /]
	do SkillCheck.resolve("slip")
	if SkillCheck.last_check_succeeded()
		do GameState.set_flag("trial_store_door_open", true)
		Store Door: The latch rises without a sound and the door swings in. Nothing inside stirs.
		=> END
	else
		do GameState.set_flag("trial_store_pick_failed", true)
		Store Door: The latch drops back and jams. It will not lift that way again.
		=> END
- "Put your shoulder to it." [if not GameState.get_flag("trial_store_door_open") /]
	do GameState.set_flag("trial_store_alarm", true)
	do GameState.set_flag("trial_store_door_open", true)
	Store Door: The bar splits and the door bangs open. In the store, two heavy shapes turn toward the noise.
	=> END
- "Leave it."
	=> END

~ trial_blast_seam
Blast Seam: A stone door with a seam cut down its middle, packed with old char where a charge was set before. Only another charge will open it.
- "Set the blasting charge in the seam and light the cord." [if GameState.item_count("tools/blasting_charge") > 0 and not GameState.get_flag("trial_blast_charge_set") /]
	do GameState.remove_items("tools/blasting_charge", 1)
	do GameState.set_flag("trial_blast_charge_set", true)
	Blast Seam: The cord catches and hisses. Get clear.
	=> END
- "Leave it."
	=> END
